   image gate: house_1828_prairie chicagology_automobile: verdict "differs", 3 difference(s) open: the basement windows under the principal ones, about y 505-580 px (about 0.25-1.45 m over grade); the porch's round arches on its front and its south side, springing from the columns, and the third column at its south-rear corner (x 440 px); the light stone face south of the bay's cheek at the print's left edge (x 0-150 px) with a pilaster at x 40-60: the print shows front wall south of the bay, where the 1911 sheet's trace starts the bay's cheek at the house's south corner
